WEBVTT

00:02.470 --> 00:05.519
Well, Dad needs to get going.

00:05.603 --> 00:08.252
I want you to try and
stay out of trouble for me.

00:08.336 --> 00:09.635
Listen to your big sister.

00:12.536 --> 00:13.852
I wanna go with you!

00:13.936 --> 00:15.533
Yeah bring us with you!

00:17.536 --> 00:21.466
I'm so sorry, but no. I can't.

00:25.536 --> 00:28.452
Hey! Stop acting so selfish
and behave yourselves.

00:28.536 --> 00:30.586
You're making this harder for him.

00:30.670 --> 00:35.399
Fine. Try and
help them to get along.

00:36.069 --> 00:37.786
I will! Good luck
with your work!

00:37.870 --> 00:41.852
Thanks. All right. Goodbye.

00:41.936 --> 00:44.452
See you soon!

00:44.536 --> 00:45.634
Darling...

00:49.336 --> 00:52.334
I'm sorry.
Take care of the kids.

00:57.470 --> 00:58.534
Let's go.

01:04.336 --> 01:06.452
Right. So, if they attack,

01:06.536 --> 01:08.586
they'll do it during my speech, yes?

01:08.670 --> 01:10.452
Nothing's guaranteed, sir,

01:10.536 --> 01:13.185
but that seems like
the strongest possibility.

01:13.269 --> 01:15.252
Most of Marley's highest ranked officers

01:15.336 --> 01:16.386
will be gathered for it.

01:16.470 --> 01:18.185
That's a rare occurrence.

01:18.269 --> 01:20.586
I should mention,
in accordance with protocol,

01:20.670 --> 01:22.786
we're waiting to determine
escape routes till later,

01:22.870 --> 01:24.652
lest the information should leak.

01:24.736 --> 01:27.786
I'll note that many VIPs
will be arriving by carriage.

01:27.870 --> 01:31.652
Got it. Seat the officers
in a special section.

01:31.736 --> 01:34.567
Group them, preferably at
the edge of the crowd.

01:35.870 --> 01:38.586
Is this really what you want to do, sir?

01:38.670 --> 01:42.119
We Tyburs haven't just
sat around enjoying ourselves.

01:42.203 --> 01:44.319
At least this generation hasn't.

01:44.403 --> 01:45.386
We've been at work.

01:45.470 --> 01:48.319
Fostering relationships
with the world's ruling class.

01:48.403 --> 01:50.852
Improving people's
perceptions of Eldians,

01:50.936 --> 01:54.133
and keeping track of
events on Paradis Island.

01:55.069 --> 01:59.252
That said, we neglected
to watch our backs.

01:59.336 --> 02:02.452
Before we knew it, our enemies
had crossed the sea,

02:02.536 --> 02:04.386
when they were at our necks.

02:04.470 --> 02:06.452
I fear that we could
find our throats slashed

02:06.536 --> 02:08.319
at any moment now.

02:08.403 --> 02:10.652
It's become clear that
the infiltrators received help

02:10.736 --> 02:13.786
from within Marley,
and the unsettling truth is

02:13.870 --> 02:16.586
that we still don't know who gave it.

02:16.670 --> 02:19.652
As you surely know,
our motherland, Marley,

02:19.736 --> 02:21.452
has many enemies.

02:21.536 --> 02:23.786
Even within our own military.

02:23.870 --> 02:25.786
And if you want to
smoke out your enemies,

02:25.870 --> 02:28.252
you light a fire beneath them.

02:28.336 --> 02:30.720
We know when and where
the foe intends to attack us.

02:30.804 --> 02:33.133
That ought to give us the advantage.

02:34.069 --> 02:38.067
Unless you have a better one,
this is the plan.

02:39.470 --> 02:41.386
Even if we can predict their moves,

02:41.470 --> 02:43.586
we're putting far too much at stake.

02:43.670 --> 02:46.386
We're sacrificing incompetent officers.

02:46.470 --> 02:49.852
If the enemy's goal is to damage
our military, then so be it.

02:49.935 --> 02:52.319
This is an opportunity.

02:52.403 --> 02:54.252
Start picking replacements now.

02:54.336 --> 02:55.786
The party will approve anyone you choose

02:55.870 --> 02:58.185
for your reformed military.

02:58.269 --> 03:01.186
But, sir, so many will die.

03:01.270 --> 03:03.386
And most will be Eldian civilians.

03:03.470 --> 03:05.567
They're spawn of the devil, aren't they?

03:09.869 --> 03:13.319
Don't change on me now, Commander.

03:13.403 --> 03:15.519
You've ordered countless
Eldians up and over

03:15.603 --> 03:17.386
to meet their deaths in a hellscape

03:17.470 --> 03:20.386
of barbed wire, landmines, and bullets.

03:20.470 --> 03:22.586
So these ones won't be wearing uniforms.

03:22.670 --> 03:24.386
That changes nothing.

03:24.470 --> 03:27.067
You just need to keep doing
what you've always done.

03:30.670 --> 03:32.786
Allow me to say one thing.

03:32.869 --> 03:34.452
This isn't a war.

03:34.536 --> 03:36.252
We don't know our enemies, their goals,

03:36.336 --> 03:38.252
or how they plan to attack us.

03:38.336 --> 03:39.319
When they make their move,

03:39.403 --> 03:42.467
the crowd surrounding you
will erupt in chaos.

03:45.670 --> 03:46.852
Lord Tybur.

03:46.936 --> 03:50.851
If we go forward with this,
and use you to bait the enemy,

03:50.935 --> 03:53.786
I doubt I'll be able to protect you.

03:53.869 --> 03:57.300
They'll do whatever it takes
to make sure that you die.

04:00.804 --> 04:04.786
Of course.
I'm prepared for that.

04:04.869 --> 04:08.652
Unless I stand on that stage,
the world will not take notice.

04:08.736 --> 04:10.386
There must be officers, ambassadors,

04:10.470 --> 04:13.567
and journalists from around
the globe in that audience.

04:14.803 --> 04:16.186
And crucially,

04:16.270 --> 04:18.252
the Eldian civilians who are killed,

04:18.336 --> 04:21.701
myself included, must be mourned by all.

04:24.203 --> 04:27.119
As victims of an
"unforeseen attack."

04:27.203 --> 04:30.452
If I escaped while
my people died en masse,

04:30.536 --> 04:33.134
the world would not rally to our cause.

04:39.670 --> 04:44.252
I fully believe the Eldian race
was spawned by the devil.

04:44.336 --> 04:49.300
But I'm just as sure that
we're devils ourselves.

07:08.792 --> 07:11.174
Gabi! Udo! Get up!

07:11.258 --> 07:12.989
On your feet! Hurry!

07:13.991 --> 07:18.089
Huh...? Zofia...?

07:20.991 --> 07:23.107
- -Zofia, no! Zofia!
- -Udo, you can't!

07:23.191 --> 07:24.689
- -Zofia!
- -Listen to me!

07:25.991 --> 07:27.974
Come and help me!
We have to lift this...

07:28.058 --> 07:29.122
Udo!

07:49.726 --> 07:53.508
You've fulfilled your
duty as a Tybur, brother.

07:53.592 --> 07:55.656
I'm so proud of you.

08:20.792 --> 08:21.974
Commander Magath!

08:22.058 --> 08:24.107
The War Hammer Titan
is getting pulverized!

08:24.191 --> 08:25.708
Commander! The Warrior
Unit's gone silent!

08:25.792 --> 08:27.907
General Calvi and the rest
of the brass are dead, sir!

08:27.991 --> 08:28.774
Should we start evacuating...

08:28.858 --> 08:30.107
We have to fall back before we're killed!

08:30.191 --> 08:31.174
We need orders!

08:31.258 --> 08:32.456
Commander!

08:34.991 --> 08:36.974
Commander?

08:37.058 --> 08:38.508
It was a harmless plink,

08:38.592 --> 08:40.574
but the first shot has now been fired.

08:40.658 --> 08:42.907
Our counterattack's begun.

08:42.991 --> 08:45.842
I never thought they'd
make such a grand entrance.

08:45.925 --> 08:48.441
What's more, that looks to be the usurper

08:48.525 --> 08:50.574
of the Founding Titan down there.

08:50.658 --> 08:52.055
The Attack Titan.

08:52.858 --> 08:55.855
We're up against Eren Jaeger himself.

08:57.258 --> 08:59.642
Just means he's saved us
a trip to the island.

08:59.726 --> 09:02.642
Get in position, men!
Prepare for battle!

09:02.726 --> 09:03.855
Understood, sir!

09:20.125 --> 09:22.574
Sheesh, what's all this commotion about?

09:22.658 --> 09:24.889
Don't just stand there!
We have to run...

09:33.058 --> 09:34.841
Now, I don't want any of you forgetting.

09:34.925 --> 09:38.055
The first attack that pierced
the enemy came from my gun.

09:43.058 --> 09:44.774
Shit! What is this?

09:44.857 --> 09:46.574
The whole town's like a battlefield!

09:46.658 --> 09:48.556
Is he okay?

09:51.991 --> 09:53.907
No. We need to
get him to the hospital.

09:53.991 --> 09:57.642
Oh no. Udo.

09:57.726 --> 09:59.174
What the hell?

09:59.258 --> 10:02.556
Falco! Where are you?

10:06.525 --> 10:08.642
Okay. What's going on here?

10:08.726 --> 10:10.574
Based on all the tremors,

10:10.658 --> 10:13.441
I think Titans must be
fighting on the surface.

10:13.525 --> 10:15.174
Wait, are you serious?

10:15.258 --> 10:16.841
You have to admit that it would explain

10:16.925 --> 10:18.974
why that soldier trapped us down here.

10:19.058 --> 10:20.974
We need to join the fight quickly.

10:21.058 --> 10:21.988
But how?

10:23.258 --> 10:24.174
What the hell?

10:24.258 --> 10:24.907
You're late!

10:24.991 --> 10:26.974
- -Sorry, Pieck!
- -Are you two okay?

10:27.058 --> 10:28.708
Yeah! Throw us a rope!

10:28.791 --> 10:29.775
On it!

10:29.858 --> 10:32.642
The Panzer Unit. How'd they
know we'd be here?

10:32.726 --> 10:34.174
I thought Beardy looked suspicious,

10:34.258 --> 10:36.508
so I told them to follow us.

10:36.592 --> 10:37.974
Back then?

10:38.058 --> 10:40.107
There's something up with this soldier.

10:40.191 --> 10:42.174
Shadow us for a while.

10:42.258 --> 10:43.907
A Titan attacked and killed Lord Tybur

10:43.991 --> 10:44.974
during his speech!

10:45.058 --> 10:45.974
For real?

10:46.058 --> 10:47.642
The War Hammer Titan's
keeping it occupied

10:47.726 --> 10:48.907
for the time being.

10:48.991 --> 10:50.508
How far to the Cart's armor?

10:50.592 --> 10:51.708
It's back at HQ!

10:51.791 --> 10:53.107
We can equip it in 15 minutes.

10:53.191 --> 10:54.107
Do it in ten.

10:54.191 --> 10:55.107
Roger that.

10:55.191 --> 10:56.574
I'm going on ahead.

10:56.658 --> 10:57.574
Hold on, Porco.

10:57.658 --> 10:59.508
Don't rush in till you know what you're...

10:59.592 --> 11:01.708
What the...?

11:01.791 --> 11:03.574
There's no way.

11:03.658 --> 11:04.989
How'd they get here?

11:48.857 --> 11:49.508
We hit it!

11:49.592 --> 11:50.774
Yeah, take that!

11:50.858 --> 11:52.108
These Anti-Titan cannons pack a punch!

11:52.192 --> 11:53.108
This is our chance.

11:53.192 --> 11:55.707
We can finish off Eren Jaeger
here and now.

11:55.791 --> 11:58.508
If we strip them of the Founding
Titan, they're finished!

11:58.592 --> 11:59.707
- -Not so.
- -Huh?

11:59.791 --> 12:00.974
If we kill the Founder,

12:01.058 --> 12:02.974
it will only postpone the problem.

12:03.058 --> 12:06.174
What we need is to have
the War Hammer Titan eat it!

12:06.258 --> 12:09.108
Our mission is to make sure that happens.

12:09.192 --> 12:11.442
Right. But, sir. It's just...

12:11.526 --> 12:12.974
It doesn't actually
look like the War Hammer's

12:13.058 --> 12:14.855
trying to eat it.

12:24.592 --> 12:25.442
Look at that!

12:25.526 --> 12:26.508
The War Hammer's a monster!

12:26.592 --> 12:28.174
It beat the Attack Titan!

12:28.258 --> 12:30.523
The War Hammer wins!

12:36.192 --> 12:39.356
That's him. Eren Jaeger.

12:46.592 --> 12:50.556
It... It's gonna finish him off!

12:52.592 --> 12:56.174
Usurper Eren Jaeger.

12:56.258 --> 13:00.022
Before you die, you may
utter your final words.

13:08.858 --> 13:10.755
It's time, Mikasa.

13:50.258 --> 13:52.556
Glad to see that all of you made it.

13:53.658 --> 13:57.556
Please. Eren. Come home.

14:06.551 --> 14:08.467
Our chain of command has been shattered.

14:08.551 --> 14:11.467
This is the ultimate test
of our military's strength.

14:11.551 --> 14:14.067
Cancel the special
vigilance training at once.

14:14.151 --> 14:17.067
Bring that entire division
down from the mountains.

14:17.150 --> 14:18.267
Call in the fleet as well.

14:18.351 --> 14:20.001
And bring in all 30,000 soldiers

14:20.085 --> 14:22.267
we have stationed to the east and west.

14:22.351 --> 14:25.467
I want the Internment Zone
sealed off! Surround us.

14:25.551 --> 14:27.467
Don't let a single Island Devil escape,

14:27.551 --> 14:29.348
especially not the Founder!

14:32.418 --> 14:35.134
Go ahead and wreak havoc while you can.

14:35.218 --> 14:37.067
Your fates are sealed.

14:37.150 --> 14:39.601
This has gone exactly as Willy planned.

14:39.685 --> 14:43.334
The entire world now considers
the Eldian Empire a threat.

14:43.418 --> 14:45.467
And every nation that
lost government officials

14:45.551 --> 14:49.401
to this massacre is
now a party to this war.

14:49.485 --> 14:53.734
This world can no longer
risk letting you live.

14:53.818 --> 14:58.067
But, you must've realized
that going into this.

14:58.150 --> 14:59.682
Which means...

15:09.218 --> 15:10.467
Damn devils!

15:10.551 --> 15:12.515
Fight! Shoot!

15:18.218 --> 15:19.667
Idiots.

15:19.751 --> 15:23.200
Hey! Are you trying to burn down
the whole Internment Zone?

15:23.284 --> 15:26.467
We need to try to keep civilian
casualties to a minimum.

15:26.551 --> 15:28.401
Understand me, Floch?

15:28.485 --> 15:30.400
Everyone here is an enemy.

15:30.484 --> 15:32.401
These are just our enemy's homes.

15:32.485 --> 15:34.200
Don't forget what they did to us.

15:34.284 --> 15:35.667
The Titans who've been
slaughtering our people

15:35.751 --> 15:37.401
for years came from here, right?

15:37.485 --> 15:39.200
They've been eating us alive!

15:39.284 --> 15:41.200
So they've got this coming and then some!

15:41.284 --> 15:43.200
Seriously, you have to
stop thinking like that.

15:43.284 --> 15:46.067
Look there.
He's telling us something.

15:46.151 --> 15:47.801
That we have to fight.

15:47.885 --> 15:49.601
We can't just cower behind our walls,

15:49.685 --> 15:51.467
waiting for death to come.

15:51.551 --> 15:53.267
We need to fight like he does.

15:53.351 --> 15:55.400
Like devils.

15:55.484 --> 15:58.467
Hey. Eren.

15:58.551 --> 16:01.615
You understand what
you've done, don't you?

16:04.351 --> 16:08.401
You've killed so many civilians.

16:08.485 --> 16:11.449
Innocent people. Kids.

16:12.351 --> 16:15.549
There's no taking this back.

16:22.485 --> 16:24.667
It's not over, Mikasa.

16:24.751 --> 16:28.066
That's impossible!

16:28.150 --> 16:30.001
I blew up the nape of its neck.

16:30.084 --> 16:32.667
And I crushed its nape
with all my strength.

16:32.751 --> 16:35.015
Yet, it's still alive.

16:41.418 --> 16:42.615
Huh.

16:45.018 --> 16:47.200
I think I get it now.

16:47.284 --> 16:49.267
The War Hammer Titan uses hardening

16:49.351 --> 16:51.534
to make whatever it needs.

16:51.618 --> 16:52.601
And it won't die,

16:52.685 --> 16:56.267
no matter how much damage
we deal to its neck.

16:56.351 --> 16:59.134
Mikasa. Keep it
occupied for me.

16:59.218 --> 17:01.748
If this works, I'll be
able to eat the War Hammer.

17:04.551 --> 17:07.067
I'm truly sorry,
but we're overwhelmed as it is.

17:07.151 --> 17:09.134
And that child is already deceased.

17:09.218 --> 17:11.267
No. Wait. You haven't
even looked at him yet!

17:11.351 --> 17:13.067
If you're actually a Warrior candidate,

17:13.151 --> 17:14.534
then wake up and look at reality.

17:14.618 --> 17:16.067
Doctor! We need you!

17:16.151 --> 17:17.982
Right! On my way!

17:21.685 --> 17:25.601
Gabi. You should
go find your family.

17:25.685 --> 17:28.667
I'm not sure if anywhere's safe, but

17:28.751 --> 17:31.735
get as far from the plaza as you can.

17:31.819 --> 17:33.667
I just need to track down Falco...

17:33.751 --> 17:35.482
I'm going, too.

17:36.218 --> 17:42.334
Because I don't get why
Udo and Zofia... needed to die.

17:42.418 --> 17:44.515
Wait. It's not safe, Gabi!

17:50.551 --> 17:51.801
Hey, stop!

17:51.885 --> 17:53.601
You're heading straight
into a war zone, kid!

17:53.685 --> 17:54.801
Gabi!

17:54.885 --> 17:56.467
What are you doing here?

17:56.551 --> 18:01.067
Oh, it's you two. I'm ready
to fight, so let me pass!

18:01.151 --> 18:02.601
Stop acting like a stupid brat.

18:02.685 --> 18:05.148
Find your family and lay low.

18:06.084 --> 18:06.934
What the...?

18:07.018 --> 18:07.801
We're under attack!

18:07.885 --> 18:08.717
Where from?

18:11.885 --> 18:12.601
Above us!

18:12.685 --> 18:15.801
Oh shit. Start
running and don't...

18:15.885 --> 18:18.415
Son of a...

18:22.218 --> 18:24.182
Oh my god.

18:36.751 --> 18:39.667
This street's blocked off.
Let's go, Sasha.

18:39.751 --> 18:40.801
Slow down.

18:40.885 --> 18:43.601
You forgot that we need to
set a lamp out, Conny.

18:43.685 --> 18:45.148
Oh. Right.

19:07.685 --> 19:09.467
We've stalled their reinforcements.

19:09.551 --> 19:11.067
What about the lights?

19:11.151 --> 19:13.067
All of them are in place now.

19:13.151 --> 19:14.667
Are things going all right?

19:14.751 --> 19:16.482
They are for now at least.

19:22.685 --> 19:26.067
If we can take that
thing out soon, we'll be fine.

19:26.151 --> 19:27.601
But that's a big if.

19:27.685 --> 19:30.282
Looks like anything could
happen at this point.

19:34.819 --> 19:37.467
The only way to find out
what will come next

19:37.551 --> 19:41.915
is to make it out of
this mess alive. So focus.

19:59.285 --> 20:01.601
I knew that something was off.

20:01.685 --> 20:03.334
There was something abnormal about

20:03.418 --> 20:06.449
the way the War Hammer materialized.

20:07.218 --> 20:09.667
It was the first time I'd seen a Titan

20:09.751 --> 20:11.582
form from the feet up.

20:13.418 --> 20:15.467
Not from its neck,

20:15.551 --> 20:18.616
but from beneath the stage
it was standing on.

20:22.285 --> 20:25.182
So that's where its body is.

20:55.485 --> 20:59.382
Damn it. The War Hammer's
about to get eaten!

21:10.218 --> 21:13.067
This is the moment I've been waiting for!

21:13.151 --> 21:16.067
I'm taking the Founder right now!

21:16.151 --> 21:17.449
Eren!

21:19.750 --> 21:22.982
Why... can't I bite?

21:25.151 --> 21:27.467
Wait. Could that be him?

21:27.551 --> 21:29.616
Is that Ackermann?

21:35.285 --> 21:37.115
I need to fall back.

21:46.018 --> 21:49.267
What the hell?

21:49.351 --> 21:51.449
Can't you see I'm a Titan?

21:54.419 --> 21:56.800
Are a bunch of humans

21:56.884 --> 22:00.482
really about to come and kill me?

22:02.485 --> 22:05.401
No. They're not humans.

22:05.485 --> 22:06.649
They're devils!

23:40.759 --> 23:43.006
The devils of Paradis.

23:43.090 --> 23:45.607
Marley's Warriors have met their match

23:45.691 --> 23:48.341
in these soldiers who
soar through the air.

23:48.425 --> 23:50.941
Gabi and Falco cry out to Reiner.

23:51.024 --> 23:52.807
Will he hear their pleas?

23:52.891 --> 23:54.988
Next episode: "Assault."
